SO-8601 formatted date time the key was invalidated.", "type": "string"}, "key": {"description": "Bitcoin address (compressed public key, usually 24 characters) that the issuer uses to revoke the certificates.", "type": "string"}}, "required": ["date", "key"], "type": "object"}, "type": "array"}, "url": {"_format": "uri", "description": "The URL where the issuer's certificates can be found", "type": "string"}}, "required": ["issuerKeys", "revocationKeys", "id", "name", "email", "url", "introductionURL", "image"], "type": "object"}, "stratum": "core", "script": "latin"}
