the Default level. The default value of this is inherited from the System setting.", "enum": ["Inherit", "Default", "Info", "Debug"], "type": "string"}, "Persist": {"default": "Inherit", "description": "The minimum log level that will be persisted. Messages sent through NSLog are at the Default level. The default value of this is inherited from the System setting.", "enum": ["Inherit", "Default", "Info", "Debug"], "type": "string"}}, "type": "object"}, "Propagate-with-Activity": {"description": "Messages are attached to the activity tree in Console and crash dumps", "type": "boolean"}, "TTL": {"description": "Changes how long a log entry will remain before being removed", "properties": {"Debug": {"description": "Debug Log Level TTL in days", "type": "number"}, "Default": {"description": "Default Log Level TTL in days", "type": "number"}, "Info": {"description": "Info Log Level TTL in days", "type": "number"}}, "type": "object"}}, "type": "object"}}, "type": "object"}}, "type": "object"}, "System": {"description": "Configure System Logging", "type": "object"}}, "title": "com.apple.system.logging", "type": "object"}, "stratum": "core", "script": "latin"}
